{"id":"bc6a9777ab02e72a","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-zfc-proper-poset.md","title":"ZFC Proper Poset","display":"df-zfc-proper-poset — ZFC Proper Poset","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-proper-poset","aliases":["58-df-zfc-proper-poset"],"display":"df-zfc-proper-poset — ZFC Proper Poset","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-proper.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-proper-poset"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-proper-poset</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-proper-poset — ZFC Proper Poset"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"faf104362ffe13b3\" href=\"?note=faf104362ffe13b3\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md\">../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8935dcac821c0104\" href=\"?note=8935dcac821c0104\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-proper.md\">../batch06/58-df-proper.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P,R\\in V\">\\(\\mathbb P,R\\in V\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\in}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\in}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8935dcac821c0104\" href=\"?note=8935dcac821c0104\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-proper.md\">../batch06/58-df-proper.md</a> 的纯成员语言和三元 proper forcing 定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProperPoset}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ProperPoset}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> 由下式定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}proper\\text{-}poset}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProperPoset}_S(\\mathbb P,R)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S(\\mathbb P,R,\\mathcal L_{\\in}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}proper\\text{-}poset}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProperPoset}_S(\\mathbb P,R)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S(\\mathbb P,R,\\mathcal L_{\\in}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>通过既有定义显式传入偏序关系；初等子结构、H_theta、可数性与下方预稠密条件不再由未编码的扩充结构表示。</li>\n<li>在包含偏序参数的初等子模型中，将参数命名为常元不改变相应的初等性条件。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":